>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#guarantee-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Guarantee</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"delivery-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Nova Post  branch delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post  parcel locker delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post courier delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://betrendy.space/oplata-i-dostavka/\">More about delivery</a></p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"payment-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Payment to the current account:</p>\n<p>Beneficiary: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED] Mariia Borysivna</p>\n<p>IBAN: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Online payment via Plata by mono</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"guarantee-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>12-month manufacturer's warranty.</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745a879958\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><b>Be Trendy Bergamot &amp; Patchouli Perfumed Body Scrub</b></p>\n<p>With cashmere proteins and patchouli essential oil. Create your own beauty magic with unique BE TRENDY products.</p>\n<p><b><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-02(2).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></b><br/>\n<strong>The exclusive cashmere formula</strong> is based on a harmonious blend of exfoliating elements: fine-grain salt, apricot seed particles, and rice flour, which gently and delicately exfoliate dead skin cells.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-01(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>Formulated with over 20 active ingredients </strong>for nourishment, hydration, restoration, and cellulite reduction.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-04(2).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>Cashmere Proteins. </strong>The use of these proteins is based on their unique ability to stimulate collagen production and maintain skin elasticity. They form a thin protective barrier on the skin's surface that locks in moisture and deeply cares for your skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Patchouli Essential Oil.</strong> It effectively improves blood microcirculation in the upper layers of the skin. Known for its antibacterial and soothing properties, patchouli oil enhances tissue elasticity and boosts overall skin tone.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><strong>The scrub is further enriched with a powerful blend of ingredients to deliver maximum results, including: </strong>Retinol, Vitamin B5, Snail Mucin, Allantoin, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Collagen, Shea Butter, Hemp Oil, and Rose Extract. Thanks to our specially developed SALT GLOW formula, your skin will radiate with a stunning, lit-from-within glow, giving you an irresistibly attractive look.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-04(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>A <b>niche fragrance</b> of seduction and endless possibilities, enveloping you in a luxurious trail that lasts <b>all day</b>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-07(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><b>It is a burst of citrus</b>, where the top note of bergamot seamlessly flows into patchouli and musk. At the heart of the fragrance pyramid, a powdery touch of <b>freesia</b> unfolds. The final notes shimmer with salty amber tones, enchanting vanilla accords, and the warm, sophisticated undertones of <b>fine tea.</b></p>\n<p><b><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/bergamot-patchouli-06(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid31de69f5aca3abb838c13e7164833f39\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid31de69f5aca3abb838c13e7164833f39\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"86b8cb26c1476939d639d639d4b5e662\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"ba607874044623e7edb3083b2ed01b9d\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_2\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"a23b2d23675f5a22d3ccb30289d90637\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-wide\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div>\n<div id=\"uid9f1339abe90bae0eac5a9b5cf079bb76\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
